push.h4_f:
iOS NSE: fhuair (iarrtas) { dì-chrioptachadh (request.content.userInfo) }
Android FCM: onMessageReceived(remoteMessage) { dì-chrioptachadh (remoteMessage.data) }
Lìon SW: self.addEventListener ('push', e => dì-chrioptachadh (e.data))

